owing its economic relationships in Southeast Asia. Now new military facilities in Laos and Cambodia are causing smaller countries to worry China's military networks are also expanding.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Solar power production approaches record high</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:63a1a1fd57a847889b3c6680d5b668768d8850e70a26d4ac988e216a90eec1ab</id><updated>2026-11-14T15:13:24Z</updated><published>2026-11-14T11:22:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-solar-power-production-approaches-record-high/live-79947500--1cc60de113f5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-solar-power-production-approaches-record-high/live-79947500?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Solar power output in Germany in 2026 has already surpassed that in all of last year. Meanwhile, experts say the country is headed for a budget crisis. DW has more.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Wolf Biermann at 90: The singer who defied East Germany</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:7a6dc4b8ef65d24d133d1f43867fa82e8cf64f7bf8c0e76f3769e3a50af0846c</id><updated>2026-11-14T15:13:27Z</updated><published>2026-11-14T10:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/wolf-biermann-at-90-the-singer-who-defied-east-germany/a-79915297--17726feda083.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/wolf-biermann-at-90-the-singer-who-defied-east-germany/a-79915297?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">His life is a reflection of contemporary German history, which Biermann has addressed via his songs and sharp wit. Turning 90, he’s as feisty as ever.</summary><category term="Culture" /></entry><entry><title>Hungary: Millions in hidden cash found in Orban graft probe</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:94f7cc8a14dd1251d783a03fd9b72a287ae16714f0a2203adc475d252dc4f536</id><updated>2026-11-14T15:13: