ladimir Putin to discuss cutting nuclear arsenals in Shenzhen next week, though a senior US official expects no agreement.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>SpaceX launches Starship rocket, fails to recover booster</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:a98b9f34d48aeb32ad092dd8e1672abad6bff46b36760b691171401ee3257b84</id><updated>2026-11-14T15:12:21Z</updated><published>2026-11-14T02:24:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/spacex-launches-starship-rocket-fails-to-recover-booster/a-79946091--bd09d60b45a7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/spacex-launches-starship-rocket-fails-to-recover-booster/a-79946091?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">SpaceX had planned to catch and later reuse both stages of its biggest rocket for the first time. But the booster exploded over the Gulf of Mexico, while the spacecraft continued into orbit.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>US lifts nationwide ground stop for airports hours after halting all departures</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:aaa8d1914f7700710f162baa4321da694be36b72e42936bf57dc6212790e8177</id><updated>2026-11-14T15:12:21Z</updated><published>2026-11-14T01:41:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/us-lifts-nationwide-ground-stop-for-airports-hours-after-halting-all-departures/a-79945062--ab4e85db51f9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/us-lifts-nationwide-ground-stop-for-airports-hours-after-halting-all-departures/a-79945062?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The US federal aviation regulator has lifted a nationwide ground stop for all airports. Trump administration officials blame "overloaded" and "outdated" systems for the hourslong halt to departures.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Tanker collides with cruise ship on Mississippi in New Orleans</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:3035242843389995e3597d5